[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_11_NAME]
Doom of Ponyville

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_11_DESC]
“And it’s not just my friendships that are important to Equestria, everyponies’ are.” — Twilight Sparkle once taught Starlight Glimmer

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_11_MARK]
Rest in peace, Ponyville

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_11_NEWS_NAME]
Battle of Ponyville

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_11_NEWS_DESC]
Who would have thought that the most popular fashion choice, could be the death knocking on the door?

The air was thick with a suffocating purple fog, a noxious veil that clung to every surface like a sinister shroud. The once vibrant streets now lay in ruin, scorched and torn asunder by the ferocity of the flames that had ravaged the town. The acrid scent of burning perfumes lingered in the air, a sickly sweet reminder of the devastation that had befallen Ponyville. The sky was painted with the eerie glow of lingering embers, casting long shadows over the desolate landscape below. Amidst the chaos, the twisted remains of buildings smoldered in the fading light, their charred skeletons standing as grim monuments to the horrors that had unfolded. Broken and blackened, they loomed like silent specters over the ruined streets. In the vast expanse of rubble, you could still make out the faded echoes of their former glory - the burger joint, the spa, the theater, the town hall, the sweet apple orchard... the only thing missing was the instigator of it all - the Canterlot Perfumery Warehouse and storefront, now reduced to ash and cinders.
It was from there that the flames and explosions had begun, consuming the entire town of Ponyville. And with it, the places and the ponies who worked there — some complicit, some innocent — were swallowed up in the inferno, and kept out of the history books.

As the fires died down and the smoke cleared, a heavy silence descended upon Ponyville, broken only by the occasional crackle of burning embers. The once cheerful town was now a ghostly shell of its former self, a tragic testament to the destructive power of the inferno that had torn through its heart.

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_11_NEWS_o]
...

[l_english.PIHC_PONYVILLE_BAD_ENDING_TOOLTIP]
Though they made different choices in the face of tragedy, if they have been able to continue their friendship under different ideas or factions, would things be different?
§RMaybe, we had a chance to change everything, or at least save something?§!

[l_simp_chinese.EVENT_SUPER_11_NAME]
小马谷的末日

[l_simp_chinese.EVENT_SUPER_11_DESC]
“不仅我的友谊对小马利亚来说很重要，大家的友谊都很重要。” —— 暮光闪闪对星光熠熠曾经的教导

[l_simp_chinese.EVENT_SUPER_11_MARK]
安息吧，小马谷

[l_simp_chinese.EVENT_SUPER_11_NEWS_NAME]
小马谷战役

[l_simp_chinese.EVENT_SUPER_11_NEWS_DESC]
谁会想到，最受欢迎的时尚选择，竟然是死神在叩响门栓？

空气中弥漫着一股令人窒息的紫色雾气，一层有毒的面纱紧紧地附着在每个表面上，就像一个邪恶的裹尸布。曾经充满活力的街道现在已经被火焰的凶猛摧毁，烧焦并撕裂成碎片。燃烧香水的刺鼻气味在空气中挥之不去，这是对小马谷所遭受的毁灭的恶心而又甜蜜的提醒。天空被残留余烬的幽暗光芒所染，投下长长的阴影，覆盖在下方荒凉的景观上。在混乱中，扭曲的建筑物的残骸在消逝的光线中冒着烟，它们被烧焦的骨架像沉重的纪念碑一样屹立在废墟的街道上。在无边无际的废墟中，你依稀能辨认出它们曾经的繁华——汉堡店、水疗馆、剧院、市政厅、香甜苹果园... 而你唯一见不到的，是已经在烈火中彻底消失的始作俑者——坎特洛特香水仓库与店面。
火焰与爆炸从那些地方开始，吞没了整个小马谷。也因此，那些地方和在那些地方工作的员工——有的是知情者，有的是无辜者——也一同在火海中隐匿，在史书中隐匿。

在火焰与烟雾消散后，一种沉重的寂静降临在小马谷，只有偶尔的燃烧余烬的噼啪声打破了宁静。曾经欢快的城镇现在成了它曾经的自己的幽灵躯壳，成为对那个曾经繁华的村庄的毁灭性力量的悲惨见证。

[l_simp_chinese.EVENT_SUPER_11_NEWS_o]
